    "tree_id": "5b558443bb7f5ea554c2ce66db76f33d95681ce5",
    "message": "[ssbuffer](fix) split-if: plan the yield carrier per slot instead of relaying through the last if\n\nThe last split-if used to re-yield every original slot, so a slot produced by\nan upstream group travelled through it as a pure passthrough (same condition,\nsame value). planYieldCaseB now classifies every original slot -- Delegated /\nNativeLast / Relay / External -- and derives carrier(s) from that one table, so\na slot is exposed by the group that actually computes it. Materialization is a\nsingle per-group loop that re-points the source if's result uses at the recorded\ncarrier results; a slot without a carrier is a hard failure, never a silent\npass-through.\n\nBehaviour is unchanged where no slot can be redirected: 52 DCV UT files dump\nbyte-identical pass output, 54 RUN-line checks pass, and relay_redirect.mlir\npins the redirect, the fully redirected (void last if) and the non-delegable\nrelay shapes.",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-27T12:41:59Z",
    "author": {
      "name": "chenwuyang",
      "email": "chenwuyang1@huawei.com"
    },
    "committer": {
      "name": "chenwuyang",
      "email": "chenwuyang1@huawei.com"
    }
  },
